    "body": "It seems we all basically agree on what the spec currently says, but given Safari seems to align while Chrome and Firefox differ, do any of us feel the spec should say something else?\r\n\r\nPut another way, @bvandersloot-mozilla do you think cookieEnabled should return true in Firefox in 3p contexts where unpartitioned cookie access is blocked (yet the browser/origin-level cookie setting is enabled)? Or should the spec change?",
